          "Build a local delivery portfolio before running: concrete examples of jobs attracted, costs reduced, or training programs placed. Voters will demand proof because they have been left behind before.",
          "Avoid culture-war framings and high-salience divisive issues (immigration, college culture) that distract from the core economic message and risk alienating the minority populations without electoral gain in a district of 73% white residents."
