          { name: "Abstract ideological appeals without material policy", tag: "avoid", why: "This district's voters are economically stretched (median income $53,016) and educationally under-resourced (15.1% college-educated). Generic ideological rhetoric disconnected from wage growth, job creation, or tax relief will fail to motivate turnout or persuasion. Any messaging must tie directly to household finances and tangible economic mobility." }
