          "Lead with older homeowner economic security: at 43.3 median age and 86% homeownership, Medicare sustainability, rural healthcare access, prescription drug costs, and property tax fairness are the material concerns of the constituency's core — and the issues most likely animating the 46% who are already looking elsewhere.",
          "Engage the combined ~12.5% Hispanic and Black community with specific constituent attention and policy responsiveness; these communities are large enough that systematic neglect translates directly into depressed turnout or active opposition in a district where the margin is only eight points.",
          "Do not campaign this seat as though 54% is a durable floor — Egan's 2023 result in a favorable demographic environment reflects a held margin, not a built one, and any candidate who consolidates only the existing coalition without addressing the opposition's concerns will find that eight-point cushion significantly thinner in a high-turnout or contested cycle."
