          "Lead on insurance costs, housing stability, and healthcare access as the economic unifiers: at $79,231 income with a 30.6% renter rate and Louisiana's systemic insurance burden, cost-of-living pressure is the shared material reality that crosses racial and tenure lines and gives a candidate language that resonates without requiring demographic targeting.",
