          "Anchor every policy message in the $59,752 income reality: healthcare costs, workforce training access, and the economic conditions facing 35-year-olds without college degrees are the material concerns of this district's majority, and specificity on these issues is what converts an uncontested incumbent into a genuinely trusted representative.",
          "Investigate and engage the ~5.3% demographic gap — in Louisiana's tribal geography, this likely includes citizens of one or more of the state's federally recognized nations, and proactive engagement with those communities closes a potential constituency blind spot before it becomes a political liability.",
          "Do not mistake 100% as 100% support: in an unopposed race, the absence of a Democratic or independent candidate suppresses any measure of dissatisfaction — governing as though the district is unanimously aligned is the fastest path to producing a credible challenger in the next cycle."
